WEBVTT

00:01:57.864 --> 00:02:00.241
because I never had access
to private lessons.

00:02:00.867 --> 00:02:03.161
So you can imagine how excited I was

00:02:03.202 --> 00:02:06.581
when I had the opportunity to take
my first professional private lesson

00:02:06.622 --> 00:02:08.875
with one of the best violists
in the world.

00:02:08.916 --> 00:02:12.378
I just knew he'd be so excited about
how much progress I'd made on my own

00:02:12.378 --> 00:02:15.423
and encourage me to become
a professional musician.

00:02:15.464 --> 00:02:18.759
So it came as such a surprise
when he told me to quit.

00:02:18.801 --> 00:02:20.595
(Laughter)

00:02:20.636 --> 00:02:24.140
He said kids like me
who didn't start playing at an early age,

00:02:24.182 --> 00:02:27.310
who didn't have access to private teachers
and the best resources,

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.728
who didn't really understand

00:02:28.728 --> 00:02:31.314
how the classical music industry
really operated,